*inheritance:instead of rewritting the same ccode in multiple place we allow child class to reuse 
the parent properties and methods.

Types of 4 inheritance in java.. 
1.Single level inheritance
2.multiple level inheritance
3.Hierarchical level inheritance
4.multilevel inheritance

*Advantages
1.reusability
2.polymorphism
3.Scalability
4.maintainability


base class-Parent class.
derived class- child class

//Abstraction meaning..22/10/2026
Abstraction is the process of showing only the important details and hiding
 internal implementations from the user.
it is focused on exposing only the neccesssary details while hiding implementation.
it can be done by interface(100 %)
abstract class(0-100%)
abstractions solves the problem at design level.

26/10/2026--
to create a abstract class we use abstract keyword.
abstract class is incomplete because abstract methods created by using abstract keyword and 
when we create  abstract method then we dont have implementation.
we cannot create instance of abstract class 
when we inherit abstract class we should provide an implementation for the abstractmethod else
we get error.

ACCESS Modifier:->

/*access Modifier defines the visiblity and the accessiblity 
of the classes and methods and other members.
they determine where these member can be accessed within the code
need of access modifier....
1.security-restrict un wanted access.

2.Encapsulation->hides internal data.
3.Controlled access->give access where required.
4.Clean design->avoid misuse of variables and methods.

Types of Access Modifiers 

1.public ->accessible from every where means same class ,differnt package or a subclass.
2.default-> accessible only in same package..
3->protected.->
Aceesible in same package as weel as in differnt sub classes.
4.Private->accessible only inside the same class 
scope same class.





wrapper class:
a wrapper class is a class convert primitive datatypes into objects.
 we have 8 primitive datatypes:
 primitive,int wrapper class 'Int',
 byte:Byte
 short:Short
 long:Long
 float:Float
 double:Double
 char:Charchter
 boolean:Boolean
 needs of wrapper class:

collections in java cannot used without wrapper class

*/